@base = http://127.0.0.1:5080

### Readiness (checks database)
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Paginated list
GET {{base}}/api/items?page=1&pageSize=12&sort=priority

### Workspace aggregation (TPL)
GET {{base}}/api/workspace

### Create
POST {{base}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review API documentation",
  "description": "Check requests, errors and example responses.",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "assigneeId": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-25"
}

### Copy id and version from the created response before calling PATCH
PATCH {{base}}/api/items/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress",
  "version": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### History
GET {{base}}/api/items/1/history

### Export
GET {{base}}/api/reports/export
